01:19:29.895 --> 01:19:32.130
And then, we're done,

01:19:32.130 --> 01:19:33.510
we go to frontier.

01:19:33.510 --> 01:19:38.025
The only thing that's left on the frontier is- is D. I'm going to just pop that off,

01:19:38.025 --> 01:19:40.155
